 "titulo": "If you hear digging at night, it isn't yours ⚰️ Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "IT ISN'T YOURS",
 "descripcion": "Eli's new job is night groundskeeper at Saint Bram's cemetery. The old keeper left four rules. Rule two: if you hear digging, it isn't yours.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you go look?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine a job where one of the rules says: if you hear *digging*, it isn't yours.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Eli is forty-one. He just took the night shift at Saint Bram's cemetery.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The old groundskeeper retired without meeting him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He left four rules taped inside the tool shed.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Lock the gates at ten. If you hear digging, it isn't yours.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Never step on *fresh dirt* after midnight.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And if a grave is open at dawn, fill it before anyone sees.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "During the day, Saint Bram's is just old stones and lawnmowers.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The first five nights are quiet. Owls, wind, one lost cat.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because on night six, rule two stopped being a joke.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 1:10 AM, Eli hears a *shovel* biting into soil.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Scrape. Pause. Scrape. Somewhere near the old section.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He takes the flashlight and follows the sound between the graves.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "There's nobody there. No shovel, no footprints.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But one grave from 1961 is covered in *fresh dark dirt*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Eli kneels and puts his hand on the ground.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The digging is still going. It's coming *from below*.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Something is coming up. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
